**Firm headings**: python/larch/lint/engine.py, python/tests/lint/test_lint_engine.py
**Acceptance**:
`python3 -m pytest python/tests/lint/test_lint_engine.py -q` passes for the scan-path suite; targeted Ruff/format/strict-type checks on the two touched files per `docs/linting.md`; `engine.py` remains unregistered and no existing lint entry points or baselines change; `run_rule` without baseline flags produces deterministic stdout/stderr and never writes repository files.
